<title>UK: World Bank sets 800 bln lire domestic bond. [CORRECTED 09:55 GMT]</title>
<headline>World Bank sets 800 bln lire domestic bond. [CORRECTED 09:55 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The World Bank has issued an 800 billion lire domestic bond, lead manager Banca di Roma said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The bond matures on March 4, 2004 and will be priced at par. The coupon will be set on February 24.</p>
<p>Payments date is March 4, 1997 (corrects year from 1994). Fees total 35 basis points and the deal will be listed in Milan.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7748</p>
</text>
